  click C_HOME href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Views/Tabs/HomeTabView.swift#L299" "sendMessage. Applies task_updates to existing rows first, then CaptureWriter.apply for the new rows, then ExamPrepSweep.run, PlanProposalSweep.runIfNeeded and the arbiter. A Yes to the study-plan question calls PlanProposalSweep.requestPlan (see the automatic creators)." _blank
  click C_EDITOR href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Views/Tabs/TasksTabView.swift#L808" "activeSheet .create onSave: NudgeTask(title, dueDate, dueTime, specificTime, priority, source manual, estimatedMinutes). Then setPlanStart(auto: false) when a clock time was picked, else setPlanDay for a chosen day, else setPlanDay(anchor) when owed today (the rent rule), else no plan; a New task chosen from a timeline slot lands at that slot. Followed by PlanProposalSweep.runIfNeeded and the arbiter." _blank
  click C_GOAL href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Views/Tabs/TasksTabView.swift#L138" "acceptGoalOffer: a 20-minute task titled for the goal, source goalOffer, undated and unplanned, goalID set. Lands in Unscheduled." _blank
  click F_CAPTURE href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Services/CaptureWriter.swift#L34" "apply(response:allTasks:goalContexts:modelContext:). Also called by TasksTabView.createSessionItem (Add your own in the session picker). Dedupe: an open row with a matching title on the same due day suppresses the item, unless that row is overdue or slipped, in which case it is deleted and replaced. A new ordered plan clears sequenceIndex on the old plan's rows. Deadline fields are written only when dueKind is deadline (or the item is an event); a start date is an intention. Plan: stated start → setPlanStart(auto: false) and a 60-minute default length; stated day → setPlanDay; deadline today → setPlanDay(anchor); a plan item with no day → setPlanDay(today); otherwise unplanned. Events never get a plan." _blank
  click H_DAY href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Models/NudgeTask.swift#L180" "setPlanDay(day): intendedDate = startOfDay(day), planDayIsAuto = false; a placement on another day is cleared, one on the same day kept. Asserts the row is not an event." _blank
  click H_START href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Models/NudgeTask.swift#L194" "setPlanStart(start, durationMinutes, auto): intendedDate = the start's day, plannedStartDate = start, plannedDurationMinutes when given, plannedIsAuto = auto; planDayIsAuto = auto only when the day is new." _blank
  click S_UNPLANNED href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Models/NudgeTask.swift#L151" "Unscheduled list (or Today when owed today, Overdue when the deadline passed)." _blank
